      "text": "A 24-bug cross-harness comparison reports Benzi reading the fewest source lines (9,125 with Sonnet vs 20,704 for Claude Code) and roughly a cent per bug on DeepSeek, while Claude Code is said to reach $0.18 per step on harder bugs."
